{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slideIndex":0,"text":"Our project focuses on motor control, specifically analyzing how individuals move their hands while reaching toward targets.\nThe overall goal is to eventually estimate how quickly participants begin correcting their movements in response to changes in the visual environment.\nFor this stage of the project, we focused on exploratory data analysis to better understand the dataset and identify important patterns before moving into modeling.\n"}
